  "limits": [
    "CPP initial address selection uses job+0x20b4 masked by 0x44. The layout builder uses job+0x20b2 equal to one. The probes also vary these predicates independently using a synthetic triplet for the layout the builder does not populate.",
    "CPP payload+0xa8 comes from job+0x59. Its nonzero path schedules a second iteration. The payload+0x84 gate must also permit processing for its address replacement to run. The ordinary producer sets this gate to one. The bypass probe injects zero.",
    "The ordinary scaler source builder uses job+0x160/+0x164/+0x168. A downstream alias from the alternate CPP planes to module 16 input is unresolved.",
    "Address calculations use 32-bit A32 arithmetic. Probes use small synthetic layouts without overflow. They establish neither allocation bounds nor pixel or DMA behavior.",
    "JPEG retries use the original descriptor assembly and count writeback. Device launch, event clear/wait and teardown are hooked; reported counts are supplied by the harness. No JPEG payload is generated."
  ]
